    <bpmn:process id="W_W5386" name="W5386. Dealer Collection, Workout, Restructuring &amp; Skip-Tracing for Missing Collateral" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Default escalated from W5385; missed cure
Frequency: ~2–6% of active dealers/yr
Volume: ~30–120 workout cases/yr
Owner: Workout/Recovery Manager
Participants: Credit Manager, Legal (VS-100), Collections, Field Examiner
Source: workflow W5386 — Dealer Collection, Workout, Restructuring &amp; Skip-Tracing for Missing Collateral</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5386_LaneSet4">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5386_Lane1" name="Workout Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5386_Task6</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5386_Task7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5386_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5386_Start5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5386_Lane2" name="Field Examiner">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5386_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5386_Lane3" name="Legal Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5386_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5386_End11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5386_Start5" name="Default escalated from W5385; missed cure">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5386_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5386_Task6" name="Assess the default: cause, dealer financial condition, and collateral status…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Assess the default: cause, dealer financial condition, and collateral status (field exam W5381 if stale).
Responsible (R): Workout Manager
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5386_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5386_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5386_Task7" name="Pursue collections: demand curtailment, negotiate a restructuring/extended cure…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Pursue collections: demand curtailment, negotiate a restructuring/extended cure where viable, or move to recovery.
Responsible (R): Workout Manager
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5386_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5386_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5386_Task8" name="For missing collateral, skip-trace the units (serial-level) to locate them for…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: For missing collateral, skip-trace the units (serial-level) to locate them for repossession (W5387).
Responsible (R): Field Examiner
Accountable (A): Workout Manager
Duration: per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5386_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5386_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5386_Task9" name="Engage Legal for demand/default notice and enforcement of the security…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Engage Legal for demand/default notice and enforcement of the security agreement (W5371).
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): Workout Manager
Duration: per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5386_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5386_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5386_Task10" name="Document the workout outcome (cured/restructured/recovery) and update the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Document the workout outcome (cured/restructured/recovery) and update the dealer risk grade/limit.
Responsible (R): Workout Manager
Accountable (A): Credit Manager
Duration: per case</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5386_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5386_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5386_End11" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5386_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5386_Annotation12">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-109: collections fraud detection &amp; case governance; CTL-796 (ensure controlled execution — Curtailment, Collections, Risk &amp; Portfolio Analytics (PA-188.3).) — restructuring approval authority.
Owner: Workout/Recovery Manager</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
