    <bpmn:process id="W_W5387" name="W5387. Collateral Repossession, Redemption &amp; Disposition of Defaulted Floor-Plan Units" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Failed workout/cure (W5386); security-agreement enforcement
Frequency: Rare (~1–3% of default cases reach repo); high impact
Volume: ~10–40 repossession events/yr
Owner: Workout/Recovery Manager
Participants: Legal (VS-100), Corporate Security (VS-159), Repo Agent, Sales (disposition)
Source: workflow W5387 — Collateral Repossession, Redemption &amp; Disposition of Defaulted Floor-Plan Units</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W5387_LaneSet6">
        <bpmn:lane id="W5387_Lane1" name="Legal Counsel">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5387_Task8</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5387_Start7</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5387_Lane2" name="Corporate Security">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5387_Task9</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5387_Lane3" name="Workout Manager">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5387_Task10</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5387_Lane4" name="Sales">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5387_Task11</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
        <bpmn:lane id="W5387_Lane5" name="Finance">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5387_Task12</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W5387_End13</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W5387_Start7" name="Failed workout/cure (W5386); security-agreement enforcement">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5387_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5387_Task8" name="Confirm the right to repossess under the security agreement (W5371) and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Confirm the right to repossess under the security agreement (W5371) and applicable law; obtain legal sign-off.
Responsible (R): Legal Counsel
Accountable (A): Workout Manager
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5387_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5387_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5387_Task9" name="Engage a licensed repo agent / Corporate Security to recover the units…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Engage a licensed repo agent / Corporate Security to recover the units (serial-level) from the dealer.
Responsible (R): Corporate Security
Accountable (A): Workout Manager
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5387_Flow17</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5387_Flow18</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5387_Task10" name="Provide the dealer a redemption window to cure and reclaim before disposition.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Provide the dealer a redemption window to cure and reclaim before disposition.
Responsible (R): Workout Manager
Accountable (A): Workout Manager
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5387_Flow18</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5387_Flow19</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5387_Task11" name="Dispose of unredeemed collateral: re-sell into BuildRight&#x27;s channels…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Dispose of unredeemed collateral: re-sell into BuildRight&#x27;s channels (VS-11/VS-32/VS-155) or wholesale to recover principal.
Responsible (R): Sales
Accountable (A): Workout Manager
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5387_Flow19</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5387_Flow20</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5387_Task12" name="Account for recovery vs. outstanding balance; post any deficiency to the dealer…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Account for recovery vs. outstanding balance; post any deficiency to the dealer and any surplus per law.
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5387_Flow20</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5387_Flow21</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W5387_End13" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W5387_Flow21</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W5387_Annotation14">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-796: ensure controlled execution — Curtailment, Collections, Risk &amp; Portfolio Analytics (PA-188.3).) — legal authorization; CTL-26 (asset recovery; CTL-21 (recovery/deficiency accounting).
