    <bpmn:process id="W_W5389" name="W5389. Loss Provisioning, Charge-off &amp; Recovery Accounting for Floor-Plan Losses" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly close; default/loss event (W5386/W5387)
Frequency: Monthly provisioning; per charge-off event
Volume: ~1 monthly provision; ~20–60 charge-offs/yr
Owner: Finance (Dealer Finance)
Participants: Credit Manager, CFO, Internal Audit (VS-21), Tax (VS-79)
Source: workflow W5389 — Loss Provisioning, Charge-off &amp; Recovery Accounting for Floor-Plan Losses</bpmn:documentation>
