        <bpmn:outgoing>W5389_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5389_Task4" name="Compute the expected credit loss (ECL) provision under PFRS 9 from…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Compute the expected credit loss (ECL) provision under PFRS 9 from aging/grade/default data (W5385/W5388).
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5389_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5389_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5389_Task5" name="Post the provision to the GL and provision contra-asset (VS-17); document…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Post the provision to the GL and provision contra-asset (VS-17); document methodology.
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5389_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5389_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5389_Task6" name="On a confirmed loss (unrecoverable): charge-off the principal net of provision…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: On a confirmed loss (unrecoverable): charge-off the principal net of provision and recovery (W5387).
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per event</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5389_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5389_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5389_Task7" name="Track recoveries post charge-off and recognize recovery income.">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 4: Track recoveries post charge-off and recognize recovery income.
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5389_Flow15</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5389_Flow16</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W5389_Task8" name="Reconcile provisions/charge-offs to the credit-risk and tax records (VS-79 BIR…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 5: Reconcile provisions/charge-offs to the credit-risk and tax records (VS-79 BIR deductibility).
Responsible (R): Finance
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: per close</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W5389_Flow16</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W5389_Flow17</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
